Feedback on that Rust program:
Spawned workers h1#87, h2#162 have no unambiguous named entry. Implement each CIR worker as a named Rust function with the same name and call it from its spawn closure. Preserve the verified CIR synchronization, resource names, and shared-state updates. Do not guess thread identity from spawn order.
Fix the Rust; do not change the design.

Output only the complete Rust program in one ```rust fence.

